@F7
Feature: F7 - Product Details # features/product_details.feature:4
  Display existing products, unavailable products, and products with zero reviews.
  Prerequisites that are unavailable must be reported as Blocked before execution.
  @TC-F7-01 @OP-F7-1 @valid
  Scenario: TC-F7-01 - View an existing product                                                           # features/product_details.feature:9
    Given the catalogue contains "iPhone" with product ID "40"                                            # None
    And catalogue or search navigation is available                                                       # None
    When I locate iPhone through the catalogue or search flow and record its displayed name and price     # None
    And I select the product to open Product Details                                                      # None
    Then the details page should identify iPhone and show its image, price, description, and availability # None
    And its displayed name and price should match the listing in the same currency and customer session   # None
    When I refresh the product details page                                                               # None
    Then product ID "40" and its details should remain displayed                                          # None
    And no product-not-found message should appear                                                        # None

  @TC-F7-02 @OP-F7-2 @invalid
  Scenario: TC-F7-02 - Request a nonexistent product                                                                  # features/product_details.feature:22
    Given product ID "999999999" is confirmed absent or replaced with a recorded confirmed absent positive numeric ID # None
    When I open a known existing product page                                                                         # None
    And I replace its product_id URL parameter with the confirmed absent ID and load the URL                          # None
    Then a clear unavailable or not-found state should appear instead of a purchasable product                        # None
    And no stale name, price, or purchase control should be presented as belonging to the absent ID                   # None
    And usable navigation back to the store should be available                                                       # None
    And no raw server error or stack trace should appear                                                              # None

  @TC-F7-03 @OP-F7-3 @edge_case
  Scenario: TC-F7-03 - View a product with zero reviews                                                          # features/product_details.feature:33
    Given product ID "40" has zero reviews or another confirmed zero-review product has its name and ID recorded # None
    When I open the selected product details page                                                                # None
